 "remarks": "Rarely available and exceptionally spacious at The Buckingham! This impressive 7th-floor, 2-bedroom, 2-bath residence offers an incredible combination of space, comfort and convenience in the heart of downtown Stamford. Beautiful herringbone wood floors, custom millwork and an expansive open living and dining area create an elegant yet inviting atmosphere, perfect for both everyday living and entertaining. Step outside onto your private balcony to enjoy fresh air and sweeping views from the seventh floor. The oversized primary suite features a generous walk-in closet and private marble bath with walk-in shower, while the spacious second bedroom offers another walk-in closet and convenient access to a full bath. The updated kitchen features granite countertops, stainless steel appliances and a breakfast area. Exceptional storage throughout adds even more convenience, while TWO garage parking spaces are a fantastic bonus for downtown living! The Buckingham offers an impressive array of amenities, including doorman service, 24-hour security, a clubroom with fireplace and kitchen, fitness room, conference room and outdoor pool. Ideally situated just moments from Stamford's vibrant dining, shopping, entertainment and transportation options, this is a fantastic opportunity to enjoy spacious downtown living in one of Stamford's established condominium communities!",
